#!RuleTest
#test FDA-SD1438 expect=noViolation domain=AC
#note "A CAGTCAT record carries ACVAL 'RADIOLOGICAL/NUCLEAR', so a 'Irradiation Field Orientation/Sequence' (IRORSEQ) record is expected -- and an ACPARMCD='IRORSEQ' record is present -> no violation."
#library standard=sendig version=ar-1-0
dataset AC label="Challenge Agent Characterization"
col STUDYID  type=Char label="Study Identifier"
col DOMAIN   type=Char label="Domain Abbreviation"
col ACSEQ    type=Num  label="Sequence Number"
col ACPARMCD type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter Short Name"
col ACPARM   type=Char label="Challenge Agent Parameter"
col ACVAL    type=Char label="Parameter Value"
---
S1 | AC | 1 | CAGTCAT  | Challenge Agent Category     | RADIOLOGICAL/NUCLEAR
S1 | AC | 2 | CAGTSUPN | Challenge Agent Supplier Name | ACME LABS
S1 | AC | 3 | IRORSEQ | Irradiation Field Orientation/Sequence | ANTERIOR-POSTERIOR
